  "titleEn": "Travel",
  "grammarTip": "The future tense combines clitic forms of htjeti (ću, ćeš, će, ćemo, ćete, će) with the infinitive: 'Ja ću putovati', or, when the infinitive comes right before it, the merged form 'putovaću' (putovati + ću). The clitic cannot open a sentence — say 'Sutra ću putovati', not 'Ću putovati sutra'. Negation is a single word — neću, nećeš, neće… + infinitive — and never merges: 'Neću putovati.'",
